geometric_shapes: accept octomap 1.10

find_package(octomap 1.9.7...<1.10.0): ROS Jazzy's own octomap is 1.9.8;
this tree's octomap component (which fcl is built with too) is 1.10.0, whose
octomap/OcTree API MoveIt uses unchanged ("Could not find a configuration
file for package octomap that is compatible with requested version range
1.9.7...<1.10.0"). Accept 1.9.7 up to 1.10.x.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 3e70189..d00c3e2 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ find_package(eigen_stl_containers REQUIRED)
 find_package(geometry_msgs REQUIRED)
 # Enforce the system package version on Ubuntu jammy and noble which is also used by libfcl-dev
 # The version is fixed to prevent ABI conflicts with ros-octomap
-find_package(octomap 1.9.7...<1.10.0 REQUIRED)
+find_package(octomap 1.9.7...<1.11.0 REQUIRED)
 find_package(QHULL REQUIRED)
 find_package(random_numbers REQUIRED)
 find_package(rclcpp REQUIRED)
